      "id": "b3.2.09",
      "n": 9,
      "prompt": "Prove: $|a-b| = |b-a|$.",
      "answer": {
        "type": "self-check"
      },
      "answerText": "(a − b)² = (b − a)²",
      "solution": [
        "(a − b)² = a² − 2ab + b².",
        "(b − a)² = b² − 2ab + a² = (a − b)².",
        "So the square roots are equal: |a − b| = |b − a|."
      ],
      "langType": "§2 ex. 20",
      "hints": [
        "Use $|x| = \\sqrt{x^2}$."
